msgstr "Off (recommended): only the MagicDNS name (e.g. srv or srv.tail1234.ts.net) counts. On: also the name a device gives itself; a foreign device with the same name can then become the target. Applies at the next start of the network; stored in the settings of this PC, not in the file."

